      "@id": "#claim",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "name": "Entry 29: pre-registration — the physical-constants sensitivity sweep (CdA × Crr × ρ)",
      "text": "A pre-registered CdA × C_rr × ρ sweep on D2–D5 maps the envelope: the medians move at the several-point scale and BOTH engines move together, so parameter error is a shared-input effect rather than a differential advantage for either. ρ and CdA enter only as the product ρ·CdA, an exact degeneracy — so the sweep identifies a product, never the factors.",
      "appearance": [
        {
          "@id": "https://github.com/danlessa/bicycling-energy-model/blob/main/research/journal/MODEL_COMPARISON_JOURNAL.md"
        }
